  lines:
  - speaker: 1
    text: "My love... I hoped I wouldn\u2019t have to reread this letter one day.
      But on the other hand, it allows me to remember her voice and imagine her still
      with me."
  - speaker: 0
    text: 'How long has it been since she left ?  '
  - speaker: 1
    text: "It\u2019s already been 4 weeks since she left to find our daughter on
      top of the mountain."
  - speaker: 1
    text: "I know it\u2019s absurd to imagine her still up there climbing the mountain.
      But deep down, I know she is still alive."
